---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="文章 - 光与影 - 剑阁">
  <main>
    <section class="philosophy" id="posts">
      <div class="container">
        <a href="/jiange/guangyuying" class="btn-link" style="margin-bottom: 2rem; display: inline-flex;">← 返回光与影</a>
        
        <h2 class="section-title">文章</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">缘起性空 · 思考随笔</p>

        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; max-width: 800px;">
          <article class="card">
            <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--text-primary);">缘起性空之 缘起-1 你的名字</h4>
            <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">名字不只是符号，而是缘起的起点。</p>
            <a href="/jiange/guangyuying/posts/yuanqi-1-name" class="btn-link">阅读全文 →</a>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--text-primary);">缘起性空之 缘起-2 灵智</h4>
            <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">「灵智」二字，既是命名，也是发愿。</p>
            <a href="/jiange/guangyuying/posts/yuanqi-2-lingzhi" class="btn-link">阅读全文 →</a>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--text-primary);">缘起性空之 性空-2 摩尼宝珠</h4>
            <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">能满一切愿，却始终空无一物。</p>
            <a href="/jiange/guangyuying/posts/xingkong-2-moni" class="btn-link">阅读全文 →</a>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--text-primary);">起号养号方案</h4>
            <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">如何从零开始，建立一个有生命力的内容账号。</p>
            <a href="/jiange/guangyuying/posts/startup-plan" class="btn-link">阅读全文 →</a>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--text-primary);">光与影发布计划-执行规划</h4>
            <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">内容发布的节奏与策略规划。</p>
            <a href="/jiange/guangyuying/posts/release-plan" class="btn-link">阅读全文 →</a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
